+/*
+ * For stream (xattr-backed) files, stat.size reports the underlying file's
+ * size, not the xattr value size. Query the xattr directly so macOS sees the
+ * correct EndOfFile (e.g. 60 for AFP_AfpInfo). Matches Samba vfs_fruit which
+ * overrides st_ex_size = AFP_INFO_SIZE.
